    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoashi kwībeegeleja hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa mpungtī go būtemi bo ng'wa Yehu, Yoashi wandya kūbiza ntemi, ūsuga ikanza lya myaka makūmi anè alī mu Yelusalemu; ū nina witanagwa Zibia, muna Beeli-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoashi walī ntūngīlīja ū miso ga ng'wa SEEBA ū mu shikū jose ījo ngabīji Yehoyada wanganikīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a mapandī ga higūlya gatīnjiwe; a banhū baalī bataalī būja koi kūfunya shitambò na kūzuukīja būbbani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoashi ūbawīla a bagabīji, “Andyagi kūyūjikuminga pyī ī hela ījo jikwenhagwa mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, jafunyiwa kūbiza shakwinha sheela, ījo banhū bakafunyaga ng'wikanza lya kūbalwa, nī jijo banhū bakafunyaga kūlwa kwisagīja kwa kūlahīla kwabo, nī jijo bakenhaga kūlwa wiyaabī wabo, biza bafunya mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī hela jenījo būlī ngabīji akūyūjanukūla kūfuma ū kūlī nang'hani wa sabo ūyo biideebile, jagūtūmama ū nīmo gwa kwībeegeleja ī hekalu ūmo ībiipile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nose ū ntemi Yoashi ūshisha myaka makūmi abīlī n'idatū alīho a ha būtemi, ī hekalu ndūhū nūūlū kūbeegelejiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi Yoashi ūng'witana ū ngabīji Yehoyada, na a bagabīji a bangī; ūbabūūja, “Nibūlī mutībeejaga ī hekalu ū mu mapandī ayo ībiipile? Hambū hambū oyagi lūūlū ū kūsola ī hela ū kūfuma ū kūbalang'hani ba sabo abo ng'wideebile nabo, jilekagi jigūtūmame ū nīmo gwa kwībeegeleja ī hekalu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji būzunya gīkī booyaga ū kūjisola ī hela jenījo ū kūfuma ū kū banhū, na gīkī ū nīmo gwa kwībeegeleja ī hekalu batūgwīta boi hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji Yehoyada ūpandīka isandīko lya mbawa, ūlīchibūla ipūndū, hūna ūlītūūla ū mu hekalu, bbihī na ng'walīlo; kū lwandī lwa būlyo ūlū ūlingīla ū mu hekalu. A bagabīji abo balang'hana a ha nyango būyūjitūūla ng'wenūmo pyī ī hela ījo banhū bajeenhaga ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būl'ikanza ūlū babona gīkī jakwīla ī hela ū ng'wisandīko, ū ng'wandīki wa ng'wikūlū nū ngabīji ntaale bizaga bajibala ī hela ījo jenhagwa ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, hūna bajitūūla mu mifuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū jamanīka ī lisaabu lyaajo, babinhaga a banhū abo baalī batūūlwa kūlwa nguno ya kūgwīmīīla ū nīmo gwa kwībeegeleja ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. A banhū benabo bajigabanhyaga mu magelè magelè; jimò babalīpaga baselemala na a banhū abo batūmamaga a ha hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jingī babalīpaga bazengi na batūji ba mawe, na kūgūla mbawa na mawe ayo gaalī gabeejiwe ng'hana ng'hana kūlwa kwībeegeleja ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, na kūbeeja milīmo yangī īyo yalī yigeleelile kūbeejiwa ū mu nīmo gwa hekalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī hela jenījo jalī jitatūmamīlagwa kūbeeja shitūmamīlo shose shose sha mu hekalu; gītī masahani ga feza, majimījo ga tala, mabbakuli ga kūseeseebelela, nūūlū mhembe, nūūlū shikolo sha zahabu shingī nasho sha kūtūmamīlwa mu hekalu yang'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūmami abo binhagwa ī hela jenījo bajitūmamīlaga mu nīmo gwa kwībeegeleja ī hekalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A binhi bajo ī hela jenījo baalī batī na nguno ya kwikala bakūbabūgīlījaga abo babinhaga gīkī babalīpe a batūmami, nguno bajitūmamīlaga mu būtūngīlīja no no no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī hela ījo jaafunyiagwa kūlwa nguno ya shakwinha sha kwihīga, na shakwinha kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi, jalī jitenhagwa ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, ī jene jalī ja bagabīji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoashi kūng'winha sabo Hazaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Hazaeli ntemi wa Alamu ūja Gaasi, kwilwisha būlūgū nago ū nzengo gwenūyo; ūgūdima; hanuma ya henaho wīgalūkīla nī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yoashi ū ntemi wa Yuda ūshisola pyī ī shikolo īsho batemi ba Yuda a bataale bakwe, ba Yehoshafati, Yeholamu, Ahazia baalī bashitūūla kūlī SEEBA; nī shisho wei ng'wenekīlī walī washitūūla kūlī SEEBA, nī zahabu ī jose ījo bakapandīka kūfuma mu chumba sha mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA ī sha kūlang'hanīla sabo, nī sha mu numba y'ikūlū; ī shose shenīsho ūntwalīla ū Hazaeli ntemi wa Alamu, hūna wīyīngīla ī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Yoashi, nī yose īyo wīyīta yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batūmami ba mu selekali yakwe būnīīla gwīnda aho atamanile, būmūlagīla Milo alī mu lūgendo lwa kūja Sila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūmami ba mu būsugi bokwe abo bakamūlaga baalī ba Yozabadi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Shimeati, na Yehozabadi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Shoa. Aho waacha ūjīkwa hamò na bakūlūgenji bakwe mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi. Amazia ng'witūnja wakwe wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
